  "notes": [
    "The original arxivR4 failure was followed by an arxiv final pass and8same-binary serial passes. These observations did not establish a cause. Diagnostic-onlyR2 then reproduces real RED3pass/1fail: a held process handle is nonsignaled at normal deadline return, cleanupUnproven=false, elapsed1962ms. This retained RED motivated an additional exit proof, not relaxed assertions.",
    "Temporary cfg(test) tracing observes3/4job members before termination and empty accounting at successful return. R3targeted15cases and4trace-case repeats pass. These attempts are nonadditive and do not certify a kernel-level scheduling cause or an early-resume/nested-accounting theory. Temporary tracing is absent from final source.",
    "Windows cleanup captures up to4096 OS-reported nested-job member synchronization handles before requesting asynchronous termination. Success requires the original root handle, every captured member handle and empty job accounting within the same existing cleanup budget. Missing/incomplete/over-capacity/over-budget membership or unavailable synchronization refuses proof. Termination is still requested if capture refuses; unassigned suspended roots retain their separately owned termination path.",
    "Member OpenProcess requests SYNCHRONIZE only. Termination remains confined to the independently owned job or its separately retained unassigned root; there is no PID-based kill. A recycled PID can only cause conservative waiting/unproven cleanup. This finite observation/OS proof is not a sandbox, a claim about every historical transient process or a hard preemption guarantee for arbitrary kernel API stalls.",
    "Two new real Windows contracts verify that a terminate-only job handle cannot turn unavailable member-query proof into success and that termination is still requested, and that a parallel unrelated owned fixture process remains alive. Original root/descendant liveness, zero-budget/fallible-spawn guards, deadline/cancellation and SQLite/blob/source restoration assertions remain. The test now reports role/PID/phase/elapsed/original error chain and typed cleanup status on failure.",
    "R4targeted17/0/0 and alltargetClippy-Dwarnings/format pass. Final15selectednativegroups preserve the unchanged media Windows symlink setupOS1314 failure. Mandatory integrated Python17/typecheck/TypeScript260+3skip pass with frozen input proofs. Newcases2; baseline8 andtrace4 are not added to case totals. No whole-native rerun is claimed.",
    "Actual Windows PostgreSQL18.6 TLSverify-full/SCRAM/channel-binding capture, Unicode private password pipe, quota/name/client-hash/auth refusals, lost stdout identity and offline traversal after server stop pass with the new native binary. All3owned fixture credentials are removed and password scanning passes. Frozen historical W3PDF native-worker text/replay passes without network reacquisition. Provider protocol code/dependencies are unchanged.",
    "Earlier OS1314/OS32/whole-native and platform qualification boundaries remain. The historical inventory/ledger identities and preceding evidence README/PR body are preserved; full upstream/non-Windows/main/release certification is not implied."
  ],
